# INVWINBL.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY, on the 4117
# items more of INVWINEH.KEY: ESC back to a list longer than the rows a
# seek passes (LV_SEEKMAX).  From the last row, item 4120, Record >
# Parts and ESC: the list opens on its first row, the row left lying
# beyond the seek, and not where the seek gave up.  From a row five
# pages down, within it, the same opens the list on that row.  View >
# Pane beside the list from the last row shows the preview with the list
# on its first row likewise.  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINBL.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER END ALT-C P
S ENDPARTS
K ESC
S FIRST
K PGDN PGDN PGDN PGDN PGDN DOWN ALT-C P
K ESC
S DEEP
K END ALT-V P
S PANE
K ALT-V P ALT-F X
